    {'id':'y4-t3-w2-l3','year':'Y4','term':'T3',     'week':2,'weekLesson':3,     'sequence':'Sequence 4','lesson':'Lesson 6',     'focus':'LKS2 Word List',     'explanation':'This sequence focuses on the following words from the LKS2 Statutory Word List: consider, quarter, remember, particular, peculiar, popular, regular, calendar, grammar, centre. perhaps, purpose, surprise, circle, certain, exercise. These words all contain the er grapheme and its alternative spellings (ar/ur/ir/re). The first set contain these graphemes at the end of each word. The second set contain these graphemes near the beginning of each word. Most often, words end in the er grapheme. When a word has Latin or French origins, it often uses the ar grapheme. Most of the words ending in this grapheme are adjectives (particular, peculiar, popular, regular). The re grapheme is extremely rare and is the British spelling (e.g. centre) for words spelled with er in American (center). It is important throughout this sequence that children are frequently asked to read the words aloud.',     'hlWords':['certain', 'peculiar', 'remember', 'surprise', 'quarter', 'circle', 'centre', 'grammar', 'regular', 'popular']},
    {'id':'y4-t3-w3-l1','year':'Y4','term':'T3',     'week':3,'weekLesson':1,     'sequence':'Sequence 4','lesson':'Lesson 7',     'focus':'LKS2 Word List',     'explanation':'This sequence focuses on the following words from the LKS2 Statutory Word List that contain alternative spellings: bicycle, centre, century, certain, circle, decide, exercise, recent (s spelled c). busy, exercise (z spelled s). fruit, group (alternative oo sound). increase (alternative long e spelled ea). material (alternative ear sound spelled er). minute (short i sound spelled u). therefore (alternative air sound spelled ere + silent e). potatoes (alternative long o spelled oe – this is because the root word ends in consonant + o so we add -es to form the plural). It is important throughout this sequence that children are frequently asked to read the words aloud.',     'hlWords':['bicycle', 'certain', 'exercise', 'decide', 'circle', 'centre', 'recent', 'century', 'occasion', 'difficult']},
